Halide is a member of the [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/Ialassa|Ialassa]] cell of [[Org/Althane/The Network|the Network]]. While they traditionally manage information flow in their own city, Halide has been known to overreach and meddle in other towns before.

Halide is an early-20s [[Bestiary/Spark of Humanity#Human|Human]] with soft features and stark, white, long hair.
